するのが最も抜けるおすすめスタイルです。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-2xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-full shadow\">FILE 02</span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: NVH00078</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug hover:text-pink-400 transition\">天然ふたなり美少女のペニクリを貪る家庭教師ニューハーフレズビアン 花宮ひめ/若宮はずき</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner group\">\n            <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/nvh00078/nvh00078pl.jpg\" alt=\"天然ふたなり美少女のペニクリを貪る家庭教師ニューハーフレズビアン 花宮ひめ/若宮はずき\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">出演女優:</strong> 花宮ひめ / 若宮はずき</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">メーカー:</strong> グローリークエスト</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">レーベル:</strong> GLORY QUEST</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">参考価格:</strong> 780~</div>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dnvh00078&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-pink-500 hover